title: Firmware/UEFI Tampering
id: 83ecc9f5-fcb7-4879-bf5d-87228fcbe569
status: experimental
description: Detects tools writing to system firmware or UEFI (flashrom, chipsec write, efivar/efibootmgr manipulation, direct SPI flash access), a destructive technique to corrupt firmware and brick systems.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1495/
logsource:
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith:
      - '/flashrom'
      - '/chipsec_util'
      - '/efibootmgr'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'write'
      - '-w'
      - 'spi'
      - 'delete'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - User
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate firmware updates
level: critical
tags:
  - attack.impact
  - attack.t1495
